WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:04.624
It’s Thank You Thursday

00:00:04.778 --> 00:00:06.889
and I believe that every entrepreneur

00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:09.325
needs to take time out to recognize the people

00:00:09.492 --> 00:00:11.327
in their life who are having a big impact

00:00:11.522 --> 00:00:13.212
or helping them; give them encouragement

00:00:13.411 --> 00:00:14.736
give them ideas, give them advice.

00:00:15.299 --> 00:00:17.371
And so today’s Thank You Thursday

00:00:17.693 --> 00:00:20.685
is Nina and Nina’s been a big part of my life

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.482
and has always been a huge supporter

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.079
of everything that I do.

00:00:24.721 --> 00:00:26.839
And I come up with some crazy ideas

00:00:27.078 --> 00:00:28.326
and I want to try some crazy things

00:00:28.566 --> 00:00:29.992
and a lot of things don’t work out

00:00:30.227 --> 00:00:34.314
but win, lose or fail I always have Nina’s support

00:00:34.573 --> 00:00:35.668
and she always has my back.

00:00:35.959 --> 00:00:36.865
She believes.

00:00:37.219 --> 00:00:39.919
And I’m willing to try a whole bunch of stuff

00:00:40.094 --> 00:00:41.480
and willing to fail at it

00:00:41.709 --> 00:00:44.292
and a lot of people are so afraid of failing

00:00:44.535 --> 00:00:45.793
that they’re not even willing to try.

00:00:46.686 --> 00:00:49.205
And you have to be willing to go through that failure

00:00:49.446 --> 00:00:50.773
and hopefully you have people behind you

00:00:50.997 --> 00:00:52.323
who support you and have your back.

00:00:52.789 --> 00:00:53.518
So one quick story;

00:00:53.789 --> 00:00:55.910
I got a lot for Nina but one quick story.

00:00:56.345 --> 00:00:58.341
I launched a new campaign under Patreon

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.254
which you’ll see in the link of all my videos

00:01:01.453 --> 00:01:02.206
now on the description

00:01:02.822 --> 00:01:05.353
and it’s basically asking people to support me.

00:01:05.883 --> 00:01:07.513
It’s, you know, if you like the videos

00:01:07.806 --> 00:01:10.194
you understand that I make these videos for free

00:01:10.629 --> 00:01:13.877
I have costs and time and a team that I support

00:01:14.085 --> 00:01:16.169
and I do it to answer your questions

00:01:16.479 --> 00:01:17.561
and to motivate and inspire you

00:01:17.916 --> 00:01:20.626
and so I ask for support, for help.

00:01:20.918 --> 00:01:22.853
And it’s basically a monthly subscription.

00:01:23.113 --> 00:01:24.940
You’re paying as little as $1 a month

00:01:25.179 --> 00:01:26.000
or whatever amount you want.

00:01:26.299 --> 00:01:27.198
So I launched the campaign.

00:01:27.632 --> 00:01:28.829
I didn’t know if it would work, right

00:01:29.023 --> 00:01:30.686
try a bunch of stuff, see what works.

00:01:30.913 --> 00:01:32.540
I’d be willing to fail.

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:36.322
And the next day I woke up and I had my first supporter

00:01:36.953 --> 00:01:39.904
and it was Nina. Surprise, surprise, right.

00:01:40.135 --> 00:01:41.201
She always believes in what I’m doing

00:01:41.569 --> 00:01:43.494
and I’m forever grateful to have somebody

00:01:43.733 --> 00:01:49.241
like that in my life who always has my back

00:01:49.514 --> 00:01:50.139
and always believes.

00:01:50.595 --> 00:01:51.741
So thank you Nina.

00:01:52.129 --> 00:01:52.825
I love you.

00:01:53.225 --> 00:01:55.150
For those of you who are watching

00:01:55.585 --> 00:01:58.024
I encourage you to take time today

00:01:58.606 --> 00:02:01.460
on Thank You Thursday to find someone in your life

00:02:01.801 --> 00:02:05.742
who is helping you, right

00:02:05.949 --> 00:02:07.742
is giving you ideas, is giving you feedback

00:02:08.083 --> 00:02:10.320
is giving you motivation, inspiration and saying

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.340
“Hey, you can do it” because as entrepreneurs

00:02:12.615 --> 00:02:13.745
we can’t do it alone.

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:15.393
So take the time out, say thank you.

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:16.329
Believe.

00:02:16.701 --> 00:02:17.823
For those of you watching, you liked the video

00:02:18.058 --> 00:02:20.045
you can support me, click on the link in the description.

00:02:20.287 --> 00:02:22.077
Leave a comment. Let me know what you think.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:24.358
And click on my face to subscribe to the channel.

00:02:24.596 --> 00:02:26.323
Thank you so much, I’ll see you soon.

